5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, friends. Let us begin this journey with open hearts and clear minds.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Good morning, everyone. Let’s keep our observations sharp and our logic clear. I’m ready to find the truth.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I’m Sakura. I love mysteries! Let’s figure out who’s sneaky. Who wants to start guessing?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I’m Midori. I’m a bit shy, but I’ll listen carefully. Let’s find the truth together.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will observe carefully. Let us establish facts before making accusations. I trust logic over emotion.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Mizuki, your logic is sound. Let us listen to Sakura’s instincts. What clues do you see?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Sakura, your enthusiasm is refreshing. Let’s not rush to judgment. I’ll watch how everyone reacts to pressure before forming conclusions.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, Servas! I’m just a curious kid, but I’ll watch closely! Mizuki, you seem super serious. Are you hiding something?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"Sakura, please don’t be so harsh. We are all just trying to survive. Let’s stay calm and kind to each other.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Sakura, your accusation is premature. We have no evidence yet. Let us wait for the night results before forming any theories.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,Ryuji is right. Patience is a virtue. Let us observe the night’s whispers before we judge.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Patience is key. I’ll keep my eyes open for any inconsistencies in our stories. Let’s remain calm and logical.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, okay okay! I’ll be quiet. But I’m still watching! Who’s the sneakiest?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,I’m glad we’re all staying calm. Let’s trust the process and see what the night reveals.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Servas. We must remain patient. Let us wait for the night to reveal its secrets before we act.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,A wise day ends with quiet reflection. May the night bring clarity to all our hearts.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Let us rest now. The night will speak for itself. I will be watching closely, as always.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Goodnight everyone! I hope the night is safe for all of us. See you in the morning!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Goodnight, everyone. I hope we all sleep peacefully. Let’s meet again with fresh eyes tomorrow.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,Goodnight. Rest well. We will assess the situation with clear minds tomorrow.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
