31,1,1,talk,Servas,,Good morning. The night has passed. Let us share what we have learned and seek the truth together.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Good morning. The night is silent, but I am watching. Who among you feels the weight of the darkness?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning! I slept like a log! Did anyone hear weird noises? I’m super curious about what happened last night!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning. I slept well, though I worry about the danger. Let’s listen to each other carefully today.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,Good morning. I have confirmed Mizuki is the werewolf. I will reveal this now to protect the village.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Ryuji, such a bold claim. Are you certain? Let us hear the evidence before we act.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Ryuji, that is a dangerous accusation. I am a villager. Why would you target me without proof?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Whoa, Ryuji! That’s super fast! Are you sure? I don’t want to hurt an innocent friend. Please explain!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Ryuji, please wait. Accusing someone so quickly is scary. We need to be sure before we hurt anyone.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I am the Seer. My divination is absolute. Mizuki is the werewolf. We must vote to execute her today.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Ryuji, your confidence is striking. Yet, without proof, we risk error. Let us listen to others before deciding.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Ryuji, your certainty is suspicious. A true Seer would not rush to execution without allowing the village to verify. I am innocent.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Ryuji, that’s scary! If you’re the Seer, why didn’t you say so yesterday? I’m confused!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Midori,,"Sakura, that is a fair point. I am worried about making a mistake. Ryuji, please explain why you stayed silent yesterday.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I remained silent to avoid alerting the werewolf. My role is verified by my certainty. Mizuki is the threat.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Ryuji, your silence is a shadow. Let us trust the process, not just one voice. Who else feels the weight of this choice?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Ryuji, your silence is a red flag. A true Seer would have shared this earlier. I urge you to reconsider your hasty judgment.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I’m scared! If Ryuji is lying, we lose a friend! Please, everyone, think carefully before voting!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Sakura. We must be careful. Please, let us not rush to a decision that could be wrong.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I understand the risk. But my duty is to the village. Mizuki is the werewolf. Trust my word.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
